## Available Styles

| Style | Stroke | Fill | Best For |
|-------|--------|------|----------|
| outlined | 2px | none | UI interfaces, web apps |
| filled | 0 | solid | Mobile apps, nav bars |
| duotone | 0 | dual | Marketing, landing pages |
| thin | 1-1.5px | none | Luxury brands, editorial |
